### @env local

### 超级管理员用户登入
POST {{baseURL}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "openid": "openid_001"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}


### 普通用户登入
POST {{baseURL}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "openid": "openid_003"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}


### 获取图片
GET http://localhost:8080/data/venue_album/de08eb41-b7cb-4f71-b009-b3a8c6f78417.jpg
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1. 创建场地 (带文件上传) (Pass)
POST {{baseURL}}/venues
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

测试大礼堂
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

这是一个用于测试 API 的多功能大礼堂，包含顶级音响设备。
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="address"

科技楼 B1 层
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="capacity"

500
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="type"

2
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="equipmentInfo"

{"wifi": true, "sound": "Dolby 7.1", "projector": true}
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="managerId"

2
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="coverImageFile"; filename="cover.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./images/cover.jpg
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photoFiles"; filename="stage.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./images/stage.jpg
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photoFiles"; filename="seats.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./images/seats.jpg
--WebAppBoundary--

### 2. 创建场地 (修复版) (Pass)
POST {{baseURL}}/venues
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary
Accept: application/json

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

纯URL测试会议室
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="address"

图书馆202
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="capacity"

50
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="type"

1
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="coverImageUrl"

https://picsum.photos/id/1018/500/300.jpg
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photoUrlList"

https://picsum.photos/id/1025/500/300.jpg
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="equipmentInfo"

{"wifi": true}
--WebAppBoundary--

### 3. 简单更新：只修改名称和描述 (无文件操作) (Pass)
POST {{baseURL}}/venues/update
Authorization: {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="id"

4
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

已更新的场地名称(测试)
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

这是通过接口更新后的描述信息，状态也改为了维护中。
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="status"

0
--WebAppBoundary--

### 4. 混合上传测试 (文件+URL) (Pass)
POST {{baseURL}}venues/update
Authorization: {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="id"

4
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="newPhotoUrlList"

https://picsum.photos/200/300.jpg
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="newPhotoFiles"; filename="test_image.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./images/stage.jpg
--WebAppBoundary--

