https://picsum.photos/id/30/500/300.jpg
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="deletePhotoIds"

e58377b4-35bd-4b39-84f0-fabc07b2afe3
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="equipmentInfo"

{"wifi": false, "projector": true, "remark": "更新后的设备列表"}
--WebAppBoundary--

### 8. 删除场地 - 每日凌晨三点彻底删除， 在此之前可以恢复 (Pass)
DELETE {{baseURL}}/venues/4/delete
Authorization: {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 9. 查询所有场地列表 (无参数) (Pass)
GET {{baseURL}}/venues
Authorization: {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 10. 根据名称模糊搜索场地 (Pass)
# 预期结果：返回名称中包含 "测试" 的场地列表
GET {{baseURL}}/venues?name=测试
Authorization: {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 11. 根据类型筛选场地 (Pass)
# 预期结果：返回 type=2 (假设是礼堂) 的所有场地
GET {{baseURL}}/venues?type=2
Authorization: {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 12. 根据状态筛选场地 (Pass)
# 预期结果：返回 status=1 (正常) 的所有场地
GET {{baseURL}}/venues?status=1
Authorization: {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 13. 组合复杂查询 (名称 + 类型 + 状态) (Pass)
# 预期结果：同时满足这三个条件的场地
GET {{baseURL}}/venues?name=测试&type=2&status=1
Authorization: {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 14. 获取单个场地详情 (Pass)
# 注意：确保 ID=4 (或你刚才创建的ID) 存在
GET {{baseURL}}/venues/5
Authorization: {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 15 获取场地开放时间 (Pass)
GET {{baseURL}}/venues/3/hours
Authorization: {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 16 设置场地开放时间 (周一至周五开放，周六日休息) (Pass)
POST {{baseURL}}/venues/3/hours
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "dayOfWeek": 1,
    "isClosed": false,
    "openTime": "09:00:00",
    "closeTime": "22:00:00"
  },
  {
    "dayOfWeek": 2,
    "isClosed": false,
    "openTime": "09:00:00",
    "closeTime": "22:00:00"
  },
  {
    "dayOfWeek": 6,
    "isClosed": true,
    "openTime": "00:00:00",
    "closeTime": "00:00:00"
  },
  {
    "dayOfWeek": 7,
    "isClosed": true
  }
]